      "cues": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "This walkthrough configures the Data tab\nfor one first-level run from OpenNeuro",
          "startSeconds": 0,
          "endSeconds": 5.91402345945946,
          "startFrame": 0,
          "endFrame": 178
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "dataset ds005085, participant sub-10015.",
          "startSeconds": 5.91402345945946,
          "endSeconds": 7.885364612612613,
          "startFrame": 177,
          "endFrame": 237
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "Before entering values in FEAT, use the\nterminal to inspect the exact",
          "startSeconds": 7.885364612612613,
          "endSeconds": 13.799388072072073,
          "startFrame": 236,
          "endFrame": 414
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "four-dimensional BOLD image.",
          "startSeconds": 13.799388072072073,
          "endSeconds": 15.277893936936938,
          "startFrame": 413,
          "endFrame": 459
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "text": "`fslval` reports 260 volumes and a\nrepetition time of 1.",
          "startSeconds": 15.277893936936938,
          "endSeconds": 20.20624681981982,
          "startFrame": 458,
          "endFrame": 607
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "text": "7 seconds.",
          "startSeconds": 20.20624681981982,
          "endSeconds": 21.1919173963964,
          "startFrame": 606,
          "endFrame": 636
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "text": "The image dimensions are 86 by 86 by 51.",
          "startSeconds": 21.1919173963964,
          "endSeconds": 25.62743499099099,
          "startFrame": 635,
          "endFrame": 769
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "text": "These header values are evidence; a\nremembered value or a value left over from",
          "startSeconds": 25.62743499099099,
          "endSeconds": 32.52712902702703,
          "startFrame": 768,
          "endFrame": 976
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "text": "another FEAT session is not.",
          "startSeconds": 32.52712902702703,
          "endSeconds": 34.99130546846847,
          "startFrame": 975,
          "endFrame": 1050
        },
        {
          "index": 10,
          "text": "The modeled run is\n`sub-10015_task-sharedreward_acq-mb3me1_bo",
          "startSeconds": 34.99130546846847,
          "endSeconds": 37.455481909909906,
          "startFrame": 1049,
          "endFrame": 1124
        },
        {
          "index": 11,
          "text": "ld.",
          "startSeconds": 37.455481909909906,
          "endSeconds": 37.9483171981982,
          "startFrame": 1123,
          "endFrame": 1139
        },
        {
          "index": 12,
          "text": "nii.",
          "startSeconds": 37.9483171981982,
          "endSeconds": 38.44115248648649,
          "startFrame": 1138,
          "endFrame": 1154
        },
        {
          "index": 13,
          "text": "gz`.",
          "startSeconds": 38.44115248648649,
          "endSeconds": 38.93398777477478,
          "startFrame": 1153,
          "endFrame": 1169
        },
        {
          "index": 14,
          "text": "Confirm all BIDS entities in the filename.",
          "startSeconds": 38.93398777477478,
          "endSeconds": 42.3838347927928,
          "startFrame": 1168,
          "endFrame": 1272
        },
        {
          "index": 15,
          "text": "Similar runs can sit beside each other,\nand selecting the wrong echo or",
          "startSeconds": 42.3838347927928,
          "endSeconds": 48.790693540540545,
          "startFrame": 1271,
          "endFrame": 1464
        },
        {
          "index": 16,
          "text": "acquisition can still produce a\ntechnically valid analysis of the wrong",
          "startSeconds": 48.790693540540545,
          "endSeconds": 54.21188171171172,
          "startFrame": 1463,
          "endFrame": 1627
        },
        {
          "index": 17,
          "text": "data.",
          "startSeconds": 54.21188171171172,
          "endSeconds": 54.70471700000001,
          "startFrame": 1626,
          "endFrame": 1642
        },
        {
          "index": 18,
          "text": "In FEAT, select First-level analysis and\nFull analysis.",
          "startSeconds": 55.554717000000004,
          "endSeconds": 59.08665843209877,
          "startFrame": 1666,
          "endFrame": 1773
        },
        {
          "index": 19,
          "text": "Set the number of inputs to one.",
          "startSeconds": 59.08665843209877,
          "endSeconds": 62.17710718518519,
          "startFrame": 1772,
          "endFrame": 1866
        },
        {
          "index": 20,
          "text": "This model represents one run from one\nparticipant.",
          "startSeconds": 62.17710718518519,
          "endSeconds": 65.70904861728395,
          "startFrame": 1865,
          "endFrame": 1972
        },
        {
          "index": 21,
          "text": "It should not be named or interpreted as a\nsubject-level combination or a group",
          "startSeconds": 65.70904861728395,
          "endSeconds": 71.8899461234568,
          "startFrame": 1971,
          "endFrame": 2157
        },
        {
          "index": 22,
          "text": "result.",
          "startSeconds": 71.8899461234568,
          "endSeconds": 72.33143880246914,
          "startFrame": 2156,
          "endFrame": 2170
        },
        {
          "index": 23,
          "text": "Choose the verified BOLD file as the\nfour-dimensional input.",
          "startSeconds": 72.33143880246914,
          "endSeconds": 76.30487291358025,
          "startFrame": 2169,
          "endFrame": 2290
        },
        {
          "index": 24,
          "text": "Do not select the JSON sidecar, a mean\nfunctional image, or a three-dimensional",
          "startSeconds": 76.30487291358025,
          "endSeconds": 82.04427774074075,
          "startFrame": 2289,
          "endFrame": 2462
        },
        {
          "index": 25,
          "text": "example volume.",
          "startSeconds": 82.04427774074074,
          "endSeconds": 82.92726309876544,
          "startFrame": 2461,
          "endFrame": 2488
        },
        {
          "index": 26,
          "text": "Once the path appears, compare its\nparticipant, task, and acquisition",
          "startSeconds": 82.92726309876544,
          "endSeconds": 87.3421898888889,
          "startFrame": 2487,
          "endFrame": 2621
        },
        {
          "index": 27,
          "text": "entities with the run named in the\nanalysis notes.",
          "startSeconds": 87.3421898888889,
          "endSeconds": 91.31562400000001,
          "startFrame": 2620,
          "endFrame": 2740
        },
        {
          "index": 28,
          "text": "Set the TR to 1.",
          "startSeconds": 92.16562400000001,
          "endSeconds": 94.24550532978724,
          "startFrame": 2764,
          "endFrame": 2828
        },
        {
          "index": 29,
          "text": "7 seconds and the number of volumes to\n260.",
          "startSeconds": 94.24550532978724,
          "endSeconds": 97.98929172340425,
          "startFrame": 2827,
          "endFrame": 2940
        },
        {
          "index": 30,
          "text": "Together those values imply a 442-second\ntime series.",
          "startSeconds": 97.98929172340426,
          "endSeconds": 101.31710185106384,
          "startFrame": 2939,
          "endFrame": 3040
        },
        {
          "index": 31,
          "text": "That duration gives us a useful boundary\ncheck for every event onset loaded later.",
          "startSeconds": 101.31710185106384,
          "endSeconds": 107.1407695744681,
          "startFrame": 3039,
          "endFrame": 3215
        },
        {
          "index": 32,
          "text": "If a timing row falls beyond the run, stop\nand repair the timing inputs before",
          "startSeconds": 107.1407695744681,
          "endSeconds": 113.38041356382979,
          "startFrame": 3214,
          "endFrame": 3402
        },
        {
          "index": 33,
          "text": "fitting the model.",
          "startSeconds": 113.38041356382979,
          "endSeconds": 114.62834236170212,
          "startFrame": 3401,
          "endFrame": 3439
        },
        {
          "index": 34,
          "text": "Set deleted volumes to zero for this\ncourse example because the supplied run",
          "startSeconds": 114.62834236170212,
          "endSeconds": 120.03603381914893,
          "startFrame": 3438,
          "endFrame": 3602
        },
        {
          "index": 35,
          "text": "and timing files are being modeled as\nstaged.",
          "startSeconds": 120.03603381914894,
          "endSeconds": 123.36384394680852,
          "startFrame": 3601,
          "endFrame": 3701
        },
        {
          "index": 36,
          "text": "For another dataset, non-steady-state\nhandling must come from the acquisition",
          "startSeconds": 123.36384394680852,
          "endSeconds": 127.52360660638298,
          "startFrame": 3700,
          "endFrame": 3826
        },
        {
          "index": 37,
          "text": "and preprocessing record rather than\nimitation of this value.",
          "startSeconds": 127.52360660638298,
          "endSeconds": 131.267393,
          "startFrame": 3825,
          "endFrame": 3939
        },
        {
          "index": 38,
          "text": "Set the output path to\n`/home/jovyan/Voxelwise-Walkthroughs/outpu",
          "startSeconds": 132.117393,
          "endSeconds": 135.03274025925924,
          "startFrame": 3963,
          "endFrame": 4051
        },
        {
          "index": 39,
          "text": "ts/sub-10015_sharedreward_mb3me1_L1_video`\n.",
          "startSeconds": 135.03274025925924,
          "endSeconds": 136.00452267901233,
          "startFrame": 4050,
          "endFrame": 4081
        },
        {
          "index": 40,
          "text": "FEAT will append `.",
          "startSeconds": 136.00452267901233,
          "endSeconds": 137.9480875185185,
          "startFrame": 4080,
          "endFrame": 4139
        },
        {
          "index": 41,
          "text": "feat`.",
          "startSeconds": 137.94808751851852,
          "endSeconds": 138.43397872839506,
          "startFrame": 4138,
          "endFrame": 4154
        },
        {
          "index": 42,
          "text": "The name captures participant, task,\nacquisition, level, and this recorded run",
          "startSeconds": 138.43397872839506,
          "endSeconds": 143.77878203703705,
          "startFrame": 4153,
          "endFrame": 4314
        },
        {
          "index": 43,
          "text": "while remaining independent of the source\ndata directory.",
          "startSeconds": 143.77878203703702,
          "endSeconds": 147.66591171604935,
          "startFrame": 4313,
          "endFrame": 4430
        },
        {
          "index": 44,
          "text": "Before leaving the tab, read the input\npath, TR, volume count, and output path",
          "startSeconds": 147.66591171604938,
          "endSeconds": 154.468388654321,
          "startFrame": 4429,
          "endFrame": 4635
        },
        {
          "index": 45,
          "text": "aloud.",
          "startSeconds": 154.468388654321,
          "endSeconds": 154.95427986419753,
          "startFrame": 4634,
          "endFrame": 4649
        },
        {
          "index": 46,
          "text": "Confirm that the output does not already\nexist.",
          "startSeconds": 154.95427986419753,
          "endSeconds": 158.84140954320986,
          "startFrame": 4648,
          "endFrame": 4766
        },
        {
          "index": 47,
          "text": "Save the design as a checkpoint.",
          "startSeconds": 158.84140954320986,
          "endSeconds": 161.7567568024691,
          "startFrame": 4765,
          "endFrame": 4853
        },
        {
          "index": 48,
          "text": "The Data tab is complete only when those\nvalues agree with the image header and the",
          "startSeconds": 161.75675680246914,
          "endSeconds": 169.53101616049383,
          "startFrame": 4852,
          "endFrame": 5086
        },
        {
          "index": 49,
          "text": "planned unit of analysis.",
          "startSeconds": 169.53101616049383,
          "endSeconds": 171.474581,
          "startFrame": 5085,
          "endFrame": 5145
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
